description: React 19 + TypeScript patterns for the treasurer UI
globs: frontend/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# React Frontend

- Functional components only. Strict TypeScript. No `any`.
- Container/presentation: hooks and fetch in `features/*/use*.tsx`; UI in `presentation.tsx`.
- Search uses `useDeferredValue`. Payment submit may use `useOptimistic` + `useFormStatus`.
- Semantic HTML, visible focus, labels (not placeholder-only), Spanish copy.
- Pass `ref` as a prop (no `forwardRef`).
- Keep interactive targets ≥ 44px. Honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.
